## Step 4: Stream at the Right Times

Timing matters more than most models realize.

Best times (generally):

* Late night (10PM–3AM)
* Weekends
* Payday periods

Avoid:

* Random inconsistent hours
* Short streams

Consistency builds returning viewers AND improves ranking.

